    "created_at": "2022-10-22T14:17:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-22T14:18:55Z",
    "body": "[aws format](https://starship.rs/config/#aws) for example has starship symbol escaping. The config docs use single quotes here. Double quotes would require escaping the backslash leading to a less readable value.\r\n\r\nUsing double quotes in the config docs is one source of the inconsistencies.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
