    "updated_at": "2022-10-22T17:15:12Z",
    "body": "> Is there a reason why the configuration documentation uses double quotes?\r\n\r\nIt used to almost always use the double quotes, and switched to single quotes in cases where it can be used to avoid needing to escape `\\`. `print-config` uses single-quotes, because the toml library we use defaults to that.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
